            "review_text": "Hoang Vo\nDa Nang, Vietnam394 contributions\n0\nSmall but quality\nFeb 2021 • Friends\nWe had lunch buffet here in Tet Holiday. I'm Vietnamese and not living outside of VN but having lunch here made me find my childhood memories. Very traditional only people who have grown up in this country can understand. I think if you're Vietnamese but living abroad for a long time, you will drop your tears when you try this place. Only one point that I didn't like, small restaurant so it was noisy cause of a big family.I don't blame them, but it would be much better if you have a less noisy place to enjoy.\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2021",
